[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2609.03556, 'An Effective SPDE Model for a Schr\"odinger Equation with a Fluctuating Magnetic Potential'] \label[lemma]{lem_time_increments_viscous}
	    For each $\nu,\tau\in(0,1)$, $\vartheta,\gamma\geq4$, and
