    BW(\mu,\nu)^2-\sum_{i=2}^n \bigg(\frac{1}{\sqrt{\lambda_i}}-\frac{1}{\sqrt{\lambda_i'}}\bigg)^2\leq \frac{2(n-1)\sqrt{2\epsilon+\epsilon^2}}{\sqrt{\lambda_{2}\lambda_2'}}.
\end{align*}

