[Lemma lem:gaus_comp_can of arXiv:2607.04514, 'Boundary-layer asymptotics for Gaussian-smoothed singular measures'] Assume (ass:standing of the paper)~(ass:standing:chart of the paper). Fix \(A>0\). There are constants \(c_0,C>0\) such that
  \begin{equation*}
