[Lemma 35 of arXiv:2510.20492, 'Heterochromatic two-arm probabilities for metric graph Gaussian free fields'] For any $d\ge 3$, $v,w\in \widetilde{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ with $|v-w|\ge d$, and $0\le a,b\le |v-w|^{d-2}$, 
  	\begin{equation}
  	\Big| 	\frac{\mathfrak{p}_{v\leftrightarrow w,a,b}  }{\bar{\mathfrak{p}}_{v\leftrightarrow w,a,b}}   -1 \Big| \lesssim (ab+1) \cdot |v-w|^{2-d}, 
    	\end{equation}
    	where $\bar{\mathfrak{p}}_{v\leftrightarrow w,a,b}:=\mathbb{K}_{\{v,w\}}(v,w)\cdot \mathfrak{q}_v(a)\cdot \mathfrak{q}_w(b)$.

