[Proposition 2 of arXiv:2506.11918, 'Central limit theorems for the Euler characteristic in the Random Connection Model for hig'] For $m,l\in\{1,\dots,\alpha+1\}$ with $m\leq l$ the following statements are true.
\begin{enumerate}
\item[$\mathrm{(i)}$] $\E{ \f {m-1} } \,=\, \frac{\beta^m}{m!} \z m m m (W)$
\item[$\mathrm{(ii)}$] $\Cov {\f {m-1}} {\f {l-1}} \,=\, \sum_{r=l}^{m+l-1} \frac{\beta^r}{(r-m)! (r-l)! (m+l-r)!} \; \z m l r (W)$
\end{enumerate}

