[Prop 10 of arXiv:2605.25762, 'Brownian Convergence of Planar Domains and Stability of the Planar Skorokhod Embedding Pro'] Let $p>0$. If for some $0<\delta<\tfrac{1}{2}$,
\begin{equation}
\max\left(\int^{\delta}_{0}|q_{n}-q|^{p}\,du,\int^{1}_{1-\delta}|q_{n}-q|^{p}\,du\right)\underset{n\to\infty}{\longrightarrow}0,
\end{equation}
then $\varphi_{n}\underset{n\to\infty}{\longrightarrow}\varphi$ in
$L^{p}_{2\pi}$ .

