\begin{align*}
    \int_{\Omega}v_0< \delta_2,
\end{align*}
the corresponding limit function $u_{\infty}\in C(\Omega)$ from Lemma (lemma4.5* of the paper) satisfies

$u_{\infty} \not\equiv$ const..

