[Corollary cor:asymp_miss_prob of arXiv:2412.00279, 'Optimal local storage policy based on stochastic intensities and its large scale behavior'] Under the same hypothesis as Theorem (thm:asymp_miss_rate of the paper), the optimal miss probability satisfies:
\begin{equation}
\lim_{N\to\infty} M_{\mathcal{C^*}}^{(N)} =  \frac{\int_0^\infty \lambda G_0\left(\frac{\theta^*}{\lambda}\right)L(d\lambda)}{\int_0^\infty \lambda L(d\lambda)}
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)

