  $\partial\Lambda=\partial_{\text{ext}}\Lambda$. Then for any contour
  $\gamma \in \overline{\mathcal C}( \Lambda)$,
  \begin{equation}
   \mathop{\sum_{\Gamma\subseteq \overline{\mathcal C}(\Lambda)}}_{\Gamma\in
     \mathcal M_{\gamma}} \prod_{\gamma' \in \Gamma}  w_{\gamma'} =
   \Xi^{\textsf{e}}_{\mathsf{Int}_{\textsf{e}} \gamma} \Xi^{\textsf{o}}_{\mathsf{Int}_{\textsf{o}}
     \gamma}. 
\end{equation}

